<p>Demonic Blood flows through your veins, increasing your spellpower by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">5, 10, 14, 17, 20</acronym> and your maximum vim by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">5, 13, 20, 26, 31.</acronym></p><p>Additionally, you will recieve a bonus to all damage equal to <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">4%, 6%, 7%, 8%, 8%</acronym> of your current vim (Currently 0%).</p>